# Path prefix -> harness suites (docs/claude/testing.md).
#
# Used by tools/renga/renga-changed-suites. A suite is a directory under
# 3rdparty/ce/tests/; tools/renga/renga-test expands it to that directory's
# test programs for ce-test.py --only.
#
# Format: "<path prefix> <suite> [<suite> ...]". Every matching line counts
# (a path under src/apps/controlpanel/ also matches src/apps/), so the
# selection is the union. Two special suite words:
#   @full   shared foundation: the full four-way set is required on that
#           commit (roadmap section 1.2, "Tiered test gates")
#   @none   notes only: no suite needed (ce-gates.sh keeps the tree key for
#           the roadmap and docs/partners/)
# A changed path that matches no line also means @full ("unknown means
# full", roadmap 1.2). The map is deliberately conservative: when in doubt
# it lists more suites, not fewer. Add a line when a new area appears.

# --- Notes and project documents -----------------------------------------
RENGA_MASTER_ROADMAP.md               @none
docs/                                 @none
